2. Section 34(1) of the Act does not apply to any biodiesel blend in any of the following circumstances:
(a)the biodiesel blend is for use in the propulsion of a motor vehicle and is carried —
(i)in a fuel supply tank of the motor vehicle; or
(ii)in a spare container of the motor vehicle in an amount not exceeding 10 litres;
(b)the biodiesel blend is for use in the propulsion of an aircraft and is carried in the fuel supply tank of the aircraft;
(c)the biodiesel blend is for use in the propulsion of a vessel and is carried in the fuel supply tank of the vessel.
